<path d="M9.21973 0.21967C9.51262 -0.0732233 9.98738 -0.0732233 10.2803 0.21967L14.2803 4.21967C14.5732 4.51256 14.5732 4.98732 14.2803 5.28022L10.2803 9.28022C9.98738 9.57311 9.51262 9.57311 9.21973 9.28022C8.92683 8.98732 8.92683 8.51256 9.21973 8.21967L11.9395 5.49994H0.75C0.335786 5.49994 0 5.16416 0 4.74994C0 4.33573 0.335786 3.99994 0.75 3.99994H11.9395L9.21973 1.28022C8.92683 0.987324 8.92683 0.512563 9.21973 0.21967Z" fill="black"/>
</svg>
</span></span></div></div><div class="card benchmark-update card-small flex-column gap-15 cover-link-parent"><div class="badge badge-circle badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Jul. 31, 2026</span></div><p class="body-3 trim color-charcoal-900">We&#39;ve launched an expansion of FrontierMath: Open Problems! The benchmark now contains 50 significant, unsolved problems from research mathematics. AI has solved three so far.</p><div class="button-parent"><a href="https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2083229557528945065" class="cover-link"></a><span class="button button-l button-text-primary  button-ui">See the thread<span class="icon x-icon "><svg width="15" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.21973 0.21967C9.51262 -0.0732233 9.98738 -0.0732233 10.2803 0.21967L14.2803 4.21967C14.5732 4.51256 14.5732 4.98732 14.2803 5.28022L10.2803 9.28022C9.98738 9.57311 9.51262 9.57311 9.21973 9.28022C8.92683 8.98732 8.92683 8.51256 9.21973 8.21967L11.9395 5.49994H0.75C0.335786 5.49994 0 5.16416 0 4.74994C0 4.33573 0.335786 3.99994 0.75 3.99994H11.9395L9.21973 1.28022C8.92683 0.987324 8.92683 0.512563 9.21973 0.21967Z" fill="black"/>
</svg>
</span></span></div></div><div class="card benchmark-update card-small flex-column gap-15 cover-link-parent"><div class="badge badge-circle badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Jul. 28, 2026</span></div><p class="body-3 trim color-charcoal-900">AI has found a presentation for the absolute Galois group of the field of 2-adic numbers — the second problem solved in FrontierMath: Open Problems.</p><div class="button-parent"><a href="https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2081894720813604997" class="cover-link"></a><span class="button button-l button-text-primary  button-ui">See the thread<span class="icon x-icon "><svg width="15" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9.21973 0.21967C9.51262 -0.0732233 9.98738 -0.0732233 10.2803 0.21967L14.2803 4.21967C14.5732 4.51256 14.5732 4.98732 14.2803 5.28022L10.2803 9.28022C9.98738 9.57311 9.51262 9.57311 9.21973 9.28022C8.92683 8.98732 8.92683 8.51256 9.21973 8.21967L11.9395 5.49994H0.75C0.335786 5.49994 0 5.16416 0 4.74994C0 4.33573 0.335786 3.99994 0.75 3.99994H11.9395L9.21973 1.28022C8.92683 0.987324 8.92683 0.512563 9.21973 0.21967Z" fill="black"/>
</svg>
</span></span></div></div></section></section><section class="section-gap-xl section-stack consultation" data-astro-cid-7vndmvra><h1 class="display-2" data-astro-cid-7vndmvra>Trusted by leaders at OpenAI, DeepMind, <br data-astro-cid-7vndmvra>and governments worldwide</h1><p class="body-1 text-charcoal-900" data-astro-cid-7vndmvra>Need deeper insights? Our team offers custom research and advisory services.</p><a href="/about/consultations" class="button button-l button-primary  button-ui">Book a consultation</a></section><footer class="section-full" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><section class="footer-content" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><div class="footer-column footer-column-primary" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><div class="logo-section" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><img src="/assets/logo/logo-white.svg" alt="Epoch AI" class="logo" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><h2 class="tagline trim" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv>Investigating the trajectory of AI for the benefit of society</h2></div><div class="newsletter-section" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><p class="newsletter-title trim" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv>Get the latest from Epoch AI in your inbox</p><a href="https://epochai.substack.com/subscribe" class="button button-l button-primary w-fit button-ui">Subscribe</a><div class="social-icons" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><a href="https://x.com/EpochAIResearch" aria-label="X (Twitter)" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><span class="icon x-icon "><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
